  "lyrics": {
    "rawText": "\nWe roll the dice, the screen lights up\nA hundred tries, we still show up\nSame old joke, but told anew\nThe punchline lands because it’s you\n\nFrom late-night chats to morning code\nWe pass the spark, we share the load\nIt loops around, it never ends\nA glitch that turns us into friends\n\nHit refresh, don’t fade it out\nLaugh it back, that’s what we’re about\nSame routine, but feels brand new\nWhen the system runs on me and you\n\nArchive days we almost lost\nSmall mistakes at zero cost\nEvery echo finds its place\nIn the rhythm that we chase\n\nStrip it down, just hands and feet\nHeartbeat, claps, the human beat\nLet it breathe, then pull it tight\nCue the groove and bring the light\n\nHit refresh, don’t fade it out\nLaugh it back, that’s what we’re about\nSame routine, but feels brand new\nWhen the system runs on me and you\n\nHit refresh\nRun it again\n"
  },
